          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "function_surface_with_section"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我们承接上一课的计算，对函数 $f(x,y)=x^2-y^2$ 求偏导数。求得对 $x$ 的偏导为 $2x$，对 $y$ 的偏导为 $-2y$。在原点 $(0,0)$ 处，两个偏导数均为零，因此原点梯度为零。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\nabla f(0,0) = (f_x(0,0), f_y(0,0)) = (0, 0)"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "极值质疑",
                  "items": [
                    "上一课 $x^2+y^2$ 在原点梯度为零且为最低点",
                    "本课 $x^2-y^2$ 在原点梯度也为零，它也是最低点吗？"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 2,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "上一课我们看到的抛物面 $x^2+y^2$ 在原点梯度为零，且原点是全局最低点。那么对于现在的 $x^2-y^2$，原点也一定是最低点吗？我们来观察它的三维曲面图形。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导思考梯度为零与最低点之间的关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "我放置了两幅马鞍面 $z=x^2-y^2$ 的三维视图。左边一幅固定 $y=0$ 平面剖切，右边一幅固定 $x=0$ 平面剖切。请观察这两个截面与曲面交线的弯曲方向。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "function_surface_with_section",
