      },
      {
        "purpose": "运用邻域定义严谨证明马鞍面原点不是局部极小点也不是局部极大点。",
        "reusable_items": [],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在我们用严谨的邻域定义来证明原点既不是局部极小点，也不是局部极大点。请看这三条核心算式。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "f(t,0) = t^2 > 0 \\quad (t \\neq 0)"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "f(0,t) = -t^2 < 0 \\quad (t \\neq 0)"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "f(0,0) = 0"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "邻域判别结论",
                  "items": [
                    "任意小的原点邻域内都同时存在高于0和低于0的点",
                    "原点既不是局部极小点，也不是局部极大点",
                    "截面必须保持过原点（t=0）"
                  ]
                },
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦于邻域内正负函数值的对比与严谨代数逻辑",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 2,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "无论取多小的邻域，只要 t 不为 0，沿 x 轴的点都比 0 大，沿 y 轴的点都比 0 小。只要找到这样一升一降两个方向，就足以彻底否定极值。需要特别注意的是，即使两个特定方向都上升，也不足以证明全局极小；但只要存在相反方向，就能否定极值。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "强调一升一降反例法否定极值的逻辑严密性",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "归纳三课分析多变量函数极值的方法，并通过自查问题总结鞍点本质。",
        "reusable_items": [],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "回顾这三节课，我们总结了分析多变量函数极值的三个核心视角：固定输出观察等高线分布、固定输入观察偏导数与截面，以及通过比较经过同一点的不同路径来判断是否为极值。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "多变量函数极值分析视角",
                  "items": [
                    "固定输出：观察等高线形状与分布",
                    "固定输入：观察偏导数与沿轴截面",
                    "路径比较：对比经过同一点的不同方向曲线"
                  ]
                },
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "梳理分析多变量函数极值的三个核心视角",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "将抛物面 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方与马鞍面 z 等于 x 平方减 y 平方在原点对比：两者的梯度均为零。但抛物面在原点邻域内除原点外所有点函数值都大于零，因而形成局部极小；而马鞍面原点任意邻域内既有正值又有负值，因此它既非局部极小也非局部极大。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\text{抛物面 } z=x^2+y^2: \\nabla z(0,0)=(0,0),\\ f(x,y)\\ge 0"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\text{马鞍面 } z=x^2-y^2: \\nabla z(0,0)=(0,0),\\ f(x,y) \\text{ 异号交替}"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "对比抛物面与马鞍面在原点的邻域函数值特征",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "请思考这个自查问题：如果一个函数沿 x 轴和 y 轴方向在原点都上升，就能断言原点是局部极小点吗？为什么？",
            "delivery": "careful",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "课内自查思考",
                  "items": [
                    "问题：沿 x、y 轴方向都上升，能否断言原点是局部极小点？"
                  ]
                },
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "提出关于坐标轴方向与全局邻域性质关系的思考题",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "答案是不能。因为沿坐标轴方向上升仅说明沿特定两条直线方向递增，并不保证在坐标轴夹角之间的斜向路径上函数值依然大于原点值。判断局部极小必须要求在原点的整个圆盘邻域内所有点都满足 f(x,y) 大于等于 f(0,0)。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "自查解答",
                  "items": [
                    "结论：不能断言。",
                    "原因：沿轴上升仅保证两个特定方向，极小点要求整个邻域内所有路径均满足 f(x,y) ≥ f(0,0)。"
                  ]
                },
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "明确局部极小点必须满足全方位邻域条件的严格定义",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
